OL,3,GNEWSAChart-topping singer and
OL,4,Atelevision host Lena Martell dies aged
OL,5,A86
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish singer and Broadway performer
OL,8,FLena Martell has died at the age of 86.
OL,10,FShe was the first solo Scottish female
OL,11,Fsinger to top the UK singles chart with
OL,12,Fher cover of the song One Day at a Time
OL,13,Fin 1979.
OL,15,FBorn Helen Thomson in Glasgow, Martell
OL,16,Frecorded a number of albums over the
OL,17,Fyears and performed in New York and Las
OL,18,FVegas alongside Frank Sinatra, Sammy
OL,19,FDavis Jr and Barbara Streisand.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
